      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 11,
      "end_line": 15,
      "raw": "- 프레임: `258:7849` `ModeBar`\n- 버튼 순서:\n  - `258:7852` `CenterView` -> `singleRecordView`\n  - `258:7853` `FocusMode` -> `imagefitContent`\n  - `258:7854` `Presentation` -> `runshowCurrentFrame`\n",
      "items": [
